<notice-bar />
<view class="privacy">这里的客户卡片只保存在本机，不上传；检索只发送所选地区（省、市、区县）和产业方向。</view>
<view wx:if="{{!editing}}" class="card"><view class="message">需要批量处理或生成 Excel？工具中心支持名单比对和客户相关通知表。须另行确认上传，不会自动发送这里的客户卡片。</view><button class="btn-primary" bindtap="tools">打开工具中心</button></view>
<view wx:if="{{error}}" class="card message">{{error}}</view>
<block wx:if="{{!editing}}">
  <view class="seg" aria-role="tablist">
    <view class="seg-item {{tab === 'docs' ? 'seg-item--on' : ''}}" data-tab="docs" bindtap="pickTab" aria-role="tab" aria-selected="{{tab === 'docs'}}">相关通知{{loaded && clients.length ? ' ' + rows.length : ''}}</view>
    <view class="seg-item {{tab === 'cards' ? 'seg-item--on' : ''}}" data-tab="cards" bindtap="pickTab" aria-role="tab" aria-selected="{{tab === 'cards'}}">客户卡片 {{clients.length}}</view>
  </view>

  <!-- 相关通知：一条通知一行，写明和哪几家客户有关（D-061），不判断能不能报 -->
  <block wx:if="{{tab === 'docs'}}">
    <view wx:if="{{!clients.length}}" class="card empty">
      <view class="empty-title">还没有客户</view>
      <view class="muted empty-sub">添加客户的地区和产业方向，这里会列出相关的申报通知、涉及哪几家客户和截止时间。不判断客户能不能申报。</view>
      <view class="btn-primary empty-btn" bindtap="edit" aria-role="button">新增客户</view>
    </view>
    <block wx:else>
      <scroll-view scroll-x class="chips" enhanced show-scrollbar="{{false}}">
        <view class="chips-row">
          <view class="chip {{only ? '' : 'chip--on'}}" data-id="" bindtap="pickOnly" aria-role="button">全部客户</view>
          <view wx:for="{{clients}}" wx:key="id" class="chip {{only === item.id ? 'chip--on' : ''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="pickOnly" aria-role="button">{{item.displayName}}</view>
        </view>
      </scroll-view>
      <view class="weak scope-note">近 90 天的相关申报通知，快截止的在前；不判断客户能不能申报。</view>
      <view wx:if="{{loadError}}" class="card load-error"><text>{{loadError}}</text><text class="link retry" bindtap="reload">重试</text></view>
      <view class="card list">
        <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="message weak">正在加载…</view>
        <block wx:else>
          <view wx:for="{{shown}}" wx:key="id" class="doc">
            <doc-row doc="{{item.doc}}" today="{{today}}" last="{{true}}" />
            <view class="involved">相关客户：{{item.names}}</view>
          </view>
          <view wx:if="{{loaded && !shown.length && !loadError}}" class="message muted">近 90 天没有和{{only ? '这家客户' : '这些客户'}}相关的申报通知</view>
        </block>
      </view>
      <view wx:if="{{truncated && !loading}}" class="weak scope-note">有的客户相关通知较多，每组地区和产业方向只列最新的 50 份。</view>
      <!-- 结果很少时给出路（10/15 走查：江苏 + 一个产业方向，近 90 天只有 1 份） -->
      <view wx:if="{{loaded && !loading && !loadError && shown.length && shown.length < 3}}" class="weak scope-note">结果较少：可以在客户卡片里多选几个产业方向，或不选产业方向、只按地区看。</view>
      <view wx:if="{{shown.length && !loading}}" class="export-bar">
        <view class="btn-primary export-btn" bindtap="exportShown" aria-role="button">导出这 {{shown.length}} 份</view>
        <view class="weak export-note">客户名称只存在本机，导出的表里不含客户名称。</view>
      </view>
    </block>
  </block>

  <!-- 客户卡片 -->
  <block wx:else>
    <view class="intro">保存客户的地区和产业方向，最多 20 家。</view>
    <view class="add btn-primary" bindtap="edit" aria-role="button">新增客户</view>
    <view wx:for="{{clients}}" wx:key="id" class="card client-card">
      <view class="section-title">{{item.displayName}}</view>
      <view class="muted summary">{{item.summary}}</view>
      <view wx:if="{{loaded && !loading && clientErrors[item.id]}}" class="weak count">暂未查询：{{clientErrors[item.id]}}</view>
      <view wx:elif="{{loaded && !loading}}" class="weak count">近 90 天相关申报通知 {{counts[item.id] || 0}} 份</view>
      <view class="actions"><view class="link action" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="edit" aria-role="button">编辑</view><view class="muted action" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="remove" aria-role="button">删除</view><view class="btn-primary search-button" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="showClient" aria-role="button">看相关通知</view></view>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{!clients.length && !error}}" class="intro">暂无本机客户卡片。</view>
  </block>
</block>
<view wx:else class="card editor">
  <view class="section-title">{{form.id ? '编辑客户' : '新增客户'}}</view>
  <view class="label">名称（可不填）</view>
  <input class="field" value="{{form.name}}" placeholder="{{placeholder}}" maxlength="40" bindinput="nameInput" aria-label="客户名称" />
  <view class="label">地区（可多选）</view>
  <view class="weak help">不选为不限地区；检索始终包含国家部委。</view>
  <view class="options"><view wx:for="{{provinces}}" wx:key="*this" class="option {{picked['regions:' + item] ? 'option--on' : ''}}" data-group="regions" data-value="{{item}}" bindtap="pick" aria-role="checkbox" aria-checked="{{!!picked['regions:' + item]}}">{{item}}</view></view>
  <view class="label">城市与区县（省市区联动，可多选）</view>
  <picker mode="region" custom-item="全部" value="{{cityRegion}}" bindchange="chooseCity"><view class="option">选择省、市或区县</view></picker>
  <view class="weak help">省市区选项来自微信，不代表已收录；区县一栏选“全部”只查市级来源。</view>
  <view class="weak help">{{cityCoverageNote}}</view>
  <view wx:if="{{cityError}}" class="help">{{cityError}}</view>
  <view wx:if="{{form.cities.length}}" class="weak help">已选城市，点此移除：</view>
  <view class="options"><view wx:for="{{form.cities}}" wx:key="*this" class="option option--on" data-value="{{item}}" bindtap="removeCity" aria-role="button" aria-label="移除城市{{item}}">{{item}}<t-icon name="close" size="24rpx" color="#2A5CE0" /></view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{districtLabels.length}}" class="weak help">已选区县，点此移除：</view>
  <view class="options"><view wx:for="{{districtLabels}}" wx:key="key" class="option option--on" data-value="{{item.key}}" bindtap="removeDistrict" aria-role="button" aria-label="移除区县{{item.label}}">{{item.label}}<t-icon name="close" size="24rpx" color="#2A5CE0" /></view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{coverageError}}" class="help">{{coverageError}}<text class="link" bindtap="loadCities">　重试</text></view>
  <view class="label">产业方向（可多选）</view>
  <view class="weak help">按标题归类，仅供检索参考，非官方分类</view>
  <view class="options"><view wx:for="{{industries}}" wx:key="*this" class="option {{picked['industries:' + item] ? 'option--on' : ''}}" data-group="industries" data-value="{{item}}" bindtap="pick" aria-role="checkbox" aria-checked="{{!!picked['industries:' + item]}}">{{item}}</view></view>
  <view class="actions"><view class="muted action" bindtap="cancel" aria-role="button">取消</view><view class="btn-primary save-button" bindtap="save" aria-role="button">保存到本机</view></view>
</view>
<view class="page-bottom"></view>
